{"id":38557,"date":"2024-11-27T06:48:41","date_gmt":"2024-11-27T05:48:41","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/trail-winter-challenge-vila-gale-2025\/"},"modified":"2026-08-23T23:21:02","modified_gmt":"2026-08-23T22:21:02","slug":"trail-winter-challenge-vila-gale-2025","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/trail-winter-challenge-vila-gale-2025\/","title":{"rendered":"Trail Winter Challenge &#8211; Vila Gal\u00e9 2025"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">A 2\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o do Trail Winter challenge S.A, vai realizar-se no dia 14 Dezembro 2025, \u00e0s 9.30h com inicio e terminus no hotel Vila Gal\u00e9 da Ericeira, independentemente das condi\u00e7\u00f5es climat\u00e9ricas desse dia, desde que a organiza\u00e7\u00e3o entenda que as mesmas n\u00e3o ofere\u00e7am risco algum para os participantes; mais uma vez com o naming right dos hot\u00e9is Vila Gal\u00e9.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Ser\u00e1 constitu\u00eddo por 1 prova de caracter competitivo: Trail longo ( +\/- 20 Km), Trail curto (+\/- 12Km) e uma caminhada de lazer ( +\/- 12 Km) ; as provas ir\u00e3o decorrer num circuito maioritariamente natural com paisagens magn\u00edficas a avistar a costa;<\/p>\n\n\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":38558,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[672,22,497,498],"event_type_2":[33,727],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-38557","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-ericeira-mafra","event_type-caminhada","event_type-trail","event_type-trail-curto","event_type-trail-longo","event_type_2-lisboa","event_type_2-lisboa-e-centro"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploa